{"id": "q0414", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 5.67, "n_chunks": 6, "n_concurrent": 6, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2182, "eot_read_ms": 18, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Imagine you are the last person on Earth. Write a diary entry describing your thoughts and feelings.", "transcript": "Imagine you are the last person on Earth. Write a diary entry describing your thoughts and feelings.", "mode": "local", "answer": "Dear diary, I woke up this morning to the sound of birds. I don't know how long it's been since I heard that. It feels like a long time. The valley is quiet today, just the river and the wind in the trees. I miss talking to people. I wonder if anyone else remembers what laughter sounds like. Sometimes I think about all the things we used to do together. I try to keep busy, tending to my garden and walking by the river. But some days are harder than others. I hope whoever comes after me finds something good here. Until then, I'll keep watching the sunrise.", "answer_ms": 2828}
{"id": "q0424", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 2.42, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2625, "eot_read_ms": 19, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Give me some examples of metamorphic rocks.", "transcript": "Give me some examples of metamorphic rocks.", "mode": "local", "answer": "A caterpillar crawls on a leaf. It spins a silky cocoon and stays still for many weeks. When it emerges, it is a butterfly with bright colors and delicate wings.", "answer_ms": 770}
{"id": "q0435", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "never", "audio_s": 1.98, "n_chunks": 2, "n_concurrent": 2, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.275, "eot_read_ms": 19, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Who are the top NFL Quarterbacks?", "transcript": "Who are the top NFL quarterbacks?", "mode": "local", "answer": "The top NFL quarterbacks are typically considered to be the most successful and accomplished players at the position based on statistics, awards, and overall impact on their teams. As of recent seasons, quarterbacks like Patrick Mahomes, Josh Allen, Justin Herbert, Joe Burrow, and Tom Brady are frequently mentioned among the best due to their performance, leadership, and ability to lead their teams to victories and championships. Rankings can vary depending on the criteria used—such as passing yards, touchdowns, playoff success, or Super Bowl wins—but these players consistently rank at the top of discussions about elite NFL quarterbacks.", "answer_ms": 2596}
